  - terminal: python -u .ofis/karalama/test_final_urls.py _(defne)_
  - terminal: python -u .ofis/karalama/check_all_report_urls.py _(defne)_
  - baglanti: https://www.ticimax.com/ticimax-ve-hepsijet-isbirligi/ _(defne)_
